{"id":"sogar","lemma":"sogar","pos":"adv","rank":294,"glosses":["even, actually, in fact"],"ipa":"/zoˈɡaːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/De-sogar.ogg/De-sogar.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sogar Kinder können dieses Buch lesen.","en":"Even children can read this book.","words":[null,{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},{"g":"to read"}]},{"text":"Ich arbeite sogar sonntags.","en":"I work even on Sunday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1983","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},null,{"g":"Sunday","l":"Sonntag"}]},{"text":"Sogar ein Kind kann das verstehen.","en":"Even a child can understand that.","words":[null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"kid"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to hear and interpret"}]},{"text":"Es könnte sogar funktionieren.","en":"It might even work.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"to work, function"}]},{"text":"Sogar Männer weinen manchmal.","en":"Even men sometimes cry.","words":[null,{"g":"man, male human being","l":"Mann"},{"g":"to weep, cry"},{"g":"sometimes"}]}]}